{"seq":10,"slug":"social-movements","title":"社会运动","stage":"DONE","category":"sociology","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements","rating":{"composite":3.89,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"社会运动\">社会运动</h1><p>从争取劳工权益的罢工，到要求平等的民权运动；从环境保护的抗议，到席卷广场的政治抗争——人类历史的进程，常常被一种特殊的力量所推动：成千上万普通人聚集起来，为了共同的目标而行动，挑战既有的秩序、追求社会的变革。本知识库面向希望理解抗争、变革与公民行动的读者，无需社会学背景，系统讲解社会运动从集体行动困境到资源、政治机会、意义建构的核心理论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-讲什么-不讲什么\">本 hub 讲什么、不讲什么</h2><p>本 hub 是一条<strong>贯通的理论主线</strong>：以&quot;集体行动如何可能&quot;为核心问题，按理论演进依次走过集体行动逻辑（奥尔森）→ 资源动员论 → 政治机会与抗争政治 → 框架与集体认同 → 数字时代。它回答的是&quot;运动为何兴起、如何组织、产生什么影响&quot;这一组机制问题。它<strong>不</strong>展开具体运动史、不做社会变迁的宏观叙事、也不深究政权暴力或博弈论本身——这些交给相邻 hub。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>看本 hub</th>\n<th>看相邻 hub</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>运动的核心理论机制（动员、机会、框架）</td>\n<td>✅ 本 hub 主线</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运动作为社会变迁引擎的宏观定位</td>\n<td>仅&quot;意义&quot;一节点到</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../sociology/social-change/social-movements/social-movement-theories\">社会变迁 / 社会运动</a>（更偏理论演进史与变迁视角）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数字技术对运动的影响</td>\n<td>&quot;数字时代&quot;一节</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../sociology/social-change/digital-sociology/social-media-society\">数字社会学</a>（社交媒体与社会的全景）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集体行动困境的形式模型</td>\n<td>直觉与社会学解读</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../economics-finance/game-theory/classic-game-models/prisoners-dilemma\">博弈论</a>、<a href=\"../../economics-finance/public-economics/public-goods/free-rider-undersupply\">公共物品</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抗争政治、革命、镇压的政治学分析</td>\n<td>&quot;抗争政治&quot;一节</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../political-science/political-violence-conflict/mobilization-process/contentious-politics-movements\">政治暴力与冲突</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运动背后的不平等结构（阶级/性别/种族）</td>\n<td>作为背景提及</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../sociology/social-stratification/racial-ethnic-inequality/institutional-racism\">社会分层</a>、<a href=\"../../marxism/class-theory-social-development/class-struggle/class-consciousness\">阶级斗争</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>注：19_sociology 下有两处&quot;社会运动&quot;——本 hub（独立、理论主线最完整）与 5_social-change 子目录（侧重理论演进史、嵌于社会变迁框架）。想系统学机制看这里；想把运动放进变迁大图景看那里。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>零基础读者（按章顺序，全程约一遍即可）</strong>：第一章基础 → 第二章集体行动逻辑（全书理论起点，务必读懂搭便车）→ 第三章资源动员 → 第四章政治机会 → 第五章框架/数字/意义。各节末尾的&quot;延伸阅读&quot;在初读时可跳过。</p>\n<p><strong>已有社会学/政治学背景</strong>：可直接从第二章奥尔森入手，把第三、四、五章当作对同一难题的三种互补回答（资源/机会/意义）来对照阅读；重点关注每章末节的&quot;贡献与局限&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>对当代抗争（数字时代运动）感兴趣</strong>：先读第一章界定 → 第二章搭便车 → 直接跳第五章第3节&quot;数字时代&quot;，再回填第三、四章理解其结构条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>无硬性前置。若已了解<strong>理性选择</strong>的基本假定（<a href=\"../../sociology/sociological-theory/modern-perspectives/rational-choice-exchange\">理性选择与交换理论</a>）与<strong>公共物品</strong>的概念（<a href=\"../../economics-finance/public-economics/public-goods/two-characteristics\">公共物品的两个特征</a>），阅读第二章会更顺畅，但本 hub 已在正文中自带必要铺垫，可边读边补。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"社会运动基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-social-movement","title":"什么是社会运动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/foundations/what-is-social-movement"},{"seq":2,"slug":"types-and-history","title":"社会运动的类型与历史","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/foundations/types-and-history"},{"seq":3,"slug":"significance","title":"研究社会运动的意义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/foundations/significance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"collective-action","title":"集体行动的逻辑","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/collective-action","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"olson-paradox","title":"奥尔森的颠覆性洞见","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/collective-action/olson-paradox"},{"seq":2,"slug":"free-rider-problem","title":"搭便车问题与困境","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/collective-action/free-rider-problem"},{"seq":3,"slug":"overcoming-the-dilemma","title":"克服困境的机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/collective-action/overcoming-the-dilemma"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"resource-mobilization","title":"资源动员论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/resource-mobilization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"from-grievance-to-mobilization","title":"从不满到动员：视角的转变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/resource-mobilization/from-grievance-to-mobilization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"resources-and-organizations","title":"资源与运动组织","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/resource-mobilization/resources-and-organizations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contributions-and-limits","title":"资源动员论的贡献与局限","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/resource-mobilization/contributions-and-limits"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"political-opportunity","title":"政治机会与抗争政治","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/political-opportunity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"political-opportunity-structure","title":"政治机会结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/political-opportunity/political-opportunity-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"political-process","title":"政治过程论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/political-opportunity/political-process"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contentious-politics","title":"抗争政治","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/political-opportunity/contentious-politics"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"framing-digital-significance","title":"框架、数字时代与意义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/framing-digital-significance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"framing","title":"框架：意义的建构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/framing-digital-significance/framing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"collective-identity-and-new-movements","title":"集体认同与新社会运动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/framing-digital-significance/collective-identity-and-new-movements"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-age","title":"数字时代的社会运动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/framing-digital-significance/digital-age"},{"seq":4,"slug":"outcomes-and-significance","title":"运动的结果与意义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/social-movements/framing-digital-significance/outcomes-and-significance"}]}]}